r rivalry between the Al-Badri and Ghanem families in Cairo's Helmeya neighbourhood. Driven by revenge, ambition, and shifting power, the series — written by Osama Anwar Okasha with over 300 actors across six seasons — is widely considered one of the greatest achievements in Arab television drama.","description_fr":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b192ygPjNQxd1ND24WxgXpSNury.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aWbZ8VAckvLDsyokfbMXszkYI3o.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":"1987","release_date":"1987-10-18","runtime_minutes":40,"status":"Ended","country":"مصر","language":"العربية","genres":["دراما"],"genre_keys":["drama"],"similar":["tv71712","tv259909","tv56570","tv97951","tv103516","tv88329","tv231503","tv80411"],"director":"أسامة أنور عكاشة","cast":[{"name":"يحيى الفخراني","character":"Selim El-Badry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lzQT2AX0yDTe63eYMjFuTIUGf4X.jpg"},{"name":"صفية العمري","character":"Nazik El-Selehdar","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rrixVov0m0g6M0l4lCOD3XnacPv.jpg"},{"name":"هشام سليم","character":"Adel Selim El-Badry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mEsLAwETgrWHGwLviulP8TlXclb.jpg"},{"name":"صلاح السعدني","character":"Soliman Ghanem","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/28grVfa5TiWx8JP7MteCPR0AGND.jpg"},{"name":"حنان شوقي","character":"Qamar Zenhom El-Samahy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wh012HByEPAXUNQnB65oFQfyovJ.jpg"},{"name":"سامح الصريطي","character":"Helmy Kholeif","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dXtyHDc9aVYslWjuucJ3VyQTcbZ.jpg"},{"name":"إنعام سالوسة","character":"Waseefa El-Marzouqi","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bbvYQgJBUXDOUkkoZ609kgFD9wD.jpg"},{"name":"ممدوح عبدالعليم","character":"Ali Selim El-Badry","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wejgX7J3H9M4XX7hMBVQoBgUGXN.jpg"},{"name":"آثار الحكيم","character":"Zohra Soliman Ghanem","profile_i